=== WEB SOURCE ANALYSIS ===
A thin orchestrator over ONE data hook (useMQTTStatus → GET /telemetry) that the
web polls in real time, deriving a rolling signal-throughput history from the
delta between consecutive total-signal counts. Section order in the web source:
  1 GlassPanel1  red fetch-error banner (shown on error && no status)
  2 StatCard     Streaming Vehicles
  3 StatCard     Total Signals
  4 StatCard     Total Batches
  5 StatCard     Signals / sec
  (AIMqttSseInspectorExplanations — a SEPARATE shared-surface parity unit, not
   one of this page's 8 manifest panels; out of scope here.)
  6 GlassPanel6  connection info (broker / uptime / topic patterns)
  7 GlassPanel7  signal-throughput AreaChart (or "collecting" copy)
  8 GlassPanel8  vehicle breakdown DataTable (+ stale counter)
Charts: 1 (AreaChart) · Maps: 0 (manifest).

=== IMPLEMENTATION (files created — proper decomposition, each ≤ 360 lines) ===
apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Telemetry/
  MQTTInspectorTypes.swift             ( 92)  Sendable value types + tuning constants
  MQTTInspectorStrings.swift           (~80)  MQTTText — 29 LocalizedStringKey (translation.mqtt.*)
  MQTTInspectorPageModel.swift         (~150) @MainActor @Observable model (state + intent + throughput)
  MQTTInspectorPageModel+Data.swift    (~130) KMP binding point, chart projection, formatters
  MQTTInspectorViews.swift             (~360) the 8 panels + TSAreaChart + TSDataTable columns
  MQTTInspectorPage.swift              (~140) main View, adaptive macOS+iOS, lifecycle, previews
  MQTTInspectorRouteRegistration.swift ( 24)  registers page on .telemetry (telemetry-debugger route)

Architecture
  • Built on the P3 shared component library (TS*) + P2 design tokens (Color.TS /
    TSSpacing / TSRadius / Font.TS) — no hardcoded colors/typography (ADR-005):
    TSGlassPanel, TSStatCard, TSAreaChart, TSChartSeries/Point, TSDataTable/TSColumn,
    TSEmptyState, TSStatusPill, TSSkeleton/TSTableSkeleton, TSFadeIn, TSPanelTitle,
    TSMetricLabel, TSPageTitle.
  • The AreaChart uses the P3 Swift Charts wrapper TSAreaChart (native Swift Charts,
    never a WKWebView).
  • Single source surfaced through an explicit MQTTDataPhase so loading / empty /
    error / success render (ADR-011); the View never shows a blank region.
  • "Live" = a lifecycle-bound 5s poll Task (.task / .onDisappear) that accumulates
    the throughput window exactly like the web `useEffect`, plus per-vehicle >120s
    staleness = ADR-013's 2-minute live-staleness window.
  • Units: the page is count/rate/uptime only (no miles/°/psi); values are formatted
    at the display boundary (formatInt/formatRate/formatUptime/relative) — nothing
    non-SI is stored or computed.
  • Model is @MainActor @Observable (matches SignalsWorkspacePageModel); type names
    namespaced (MQTT*) to avoid module-wide symbol collisions; no `import Shared`.
  • Localization: all 29 translation.mqtt.* keys ALREADY EXIST in
    Localizable.xcstrings with the exact web English values — verified, so NO catalog
    edit was required (zero hardcoded literals; web key names preserved, ADR-014).

